creatures:
- name: Red Dragon Wyrmling
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 17  
      **Hit Points** 75 (rollable(dice=10d8 + 30,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Climb 30 ft., Fly 60 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Initiative) (12)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=19)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** fire  
      **Senses** blindsight 10 ft., darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 14  
      **Languages** Draconic  
      **Challenge** 4 (1,100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes two Rend attacks.

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+4,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=1d6,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Fire damage.

      ***Fire Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Fire Breath])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 13, each creature in a 15-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=7d6,dicelabel=Damage [Fire Breath]) Fire damage. *Success:* Half damage.

    type: custom
